entries[125594] = { ["name"] = "Banquet of the Wok", ["text"] = "2 sec cast 5\nReagents:\n100 Year Soy Sauce , Giant Mantis Shrimp (10), Raw Crocolisk Belly (10), Red Blossom Leek (50)\n(10)\n90\nUse: Set out a Banquet of the Wok to feed up to 10 people in your raid or party!\n\nRestores 300000 health and ( 75000 / 5 * 20) mana over 20 sec. If you spend at least 10 seconds eating you will become well fed and gain 250 in a stat for 1 hour. May benefit some more than others." }
